    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this beautiful 3 bedroom duplex to the market for sale. \n\nThis property has been meticulously well maintained by its current owners and comes to the market in excellent condition throughout. Offering ample living accommodation the property briefly comprises of entrance hallway, kitchen/dining, utility room, living room all downstairs. Upstairs, there are three good sized bedrooms, the main of which is ensuite and the family sized bathroom. This property benefits from a private sun filled South facing maintenance free rear garden and South facing balcony off the kitchen area. \n\nLocated in a much sought after area, The Waterways complex is ideally located centrally to Sallins Village which is home to a host of amenities including supermarkets, bars, restaurants. The train station offers direct access to Dublin and is located only a short walk (c.2 minutes) away.\n\nViewing is highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Tiled flooring, light fitting, under stairs storage, alarm point, radiator and radiator cover \n\nKitchen: Tiled flooring, light fittings, fully fitted solid wood kitchen, area fully plumbed, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, oven, hob, extractor fan, integrated dishwasher, fridge freezer, radiator, doorway access to balcony area \n\nUtility Room: Washer and dryer, light fitting\n\nLiving Area: Solid wood flooring, light fitting, feature fireplace piped for gas fire, feature bay window, radiator \n\nLanding: Carpet flooring, light fitting, attic access, hot press with shelving and storage\n\nMaster Bedroom: Wooden flooring, light fitting, fully fitted wardrobe, radiator \n\nEnsuite: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, shower, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket\n\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring, light fitting, radiator \n\nBedroom 3: Wooden flooring, light fitting, fitted wardrobe, radiator \n\nFamily Bathroom: Tiled floor to ceiling, bath with pump shower, WHB, WC, radiator \n\nFeatures:\n\nManagement fees approx. 1,800 per annum\nTwo (X2) parking spaces with Duplex apartment\nAlarmed\nHardwood front door\nWired for Satellite TV\nWired for Broadband/WiFi\nPVC double glazed windows \nSelected curtains and light fittings included \nGarden shed \nMains water\nMains sewage\nNatural gas heating system\nBuilt in 2005\nc.95.34sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
